cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "NanoDrop 1000 via PyLabRobot — a working demo"
abstract: >-
  Driving a legacy Thermo Scientific NanoDrop ND-1000 spectrophotometer entirely
  through PyLabRobot on macOS, with a real UV absorbance spectrum of paracetamol,
  raw data, plots, and two hardware-verified macOS driver fixes.
